            <td data-th="Atoms" class="lt-chem-19947">S<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>&#8203;2</sub></td>
            <td data-th="Atomic weights" class="lt-chem-19947">molecular mass of S<sub>2</sub>Cl<sub>&#8203;2</sub> = 135.036 amu</td>
